RK3588S Orange Pi 5B HDMI 4K120 enablement baseline.

This baseline keeps only the display changes needed for high-bandwidth HDMI
modes on the Orange Pi 5B: SCDC scrambling, Rockchip HDMI QP YCbCr 4:2:0
fallback validation, and a higher VOP ACLK request for 4K120 scanout.

